### HEALTH CHECK
GET  http://localhost:3000/api/health

#### CREATE FOLDER
POST http://localhost:3000/api/storage-items
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Ukipo 2", "type": "FOLDER"}
> {% client.global.set("folderId", response.body.id); %}

#### CREATE FOLDER IN FOLDER
POST http://localhost:3000/api/storage-items
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "UUkipo 2", "type": "FOLDER","parentId": "{{folderId}}"}
> {% client.global.set("folderId", response.body.id); %}


### Create file in folder
POST http://localhost:3000/api/storage-items
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "notes_kipo3.txt", "type": "FILE", "parentId": "{{folderId}}"}

### List root
GET http://localhost:3000/api/storage-items

### List folder By ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/storage-items?parentId={{folderId}}

### Delete folder
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/storage-items/{{folderId}}


### Search everywhere
GET http://localhost:3000/api/storage-items/search?name=notes.txt

### Search inside folder
GET http://localhost:3000/api/storage-items/search?name=notes.txt&parentId={{folderId}}

### Autocomplete
GET http://localhost:3000/api/storage-items/autocomplete?prefix=no


